# Page Section Workflow

## Core rule
- Build every screen **section by section**, never a full page in one task.
- For each section: **create the component first**, then use it on the screen.
- Do not start the next section until the user asks for it.

## Current focus
- Active screen: **Home**
- Home section order:
  1. App navigation (`AppShell` owns breakpoint; `AppSideNav` / `AppBottomNav`)
  2. Categories
  3. Shops / products by category (rows)
  4. Remaining Home blocks as needed

## Placement
- Reusable pieces: `shared/.../ui/components/`
- App chrome navigation: `shared/.../ui/navigation/`
- Screen-specific sections (optional): `shared/.../ui/sections/home/`
- Screen assembly: `shared/.../ui/screens/HomeScreen.kt`
- Shell: `shared/.../ui/shell/AppShell.kt`

## Visual reference
- Use `docs/ui-reference/` screenshots only for the **active** section.
- Match shop.app look with Persian RTL and `VitranTheme`.
- Do **not** use Material3 `NavigationBar` / `NavigationRail` for app chrome.

## When to use
- Always, for any screen/section UI work in this repo.

## When to update
- Active screen changes (e.g. leave Home for Explore).
- Home section order changes.
- Package paths for components/screens settle or move.
